Automatic altar-save history after the USA final index write completes successfully.
Preserve original async/resume behavior and reject pending, failed, short and other-slot writes.
Publish card copies only after data and metadata close successfully; share the writer with F1.
Host-thread notification and launcher history use existing paths. No savestates or game-data edits.
Validated with production-wrapper/filesystem tests and private-card altar save/reload (see docs).

